  99:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcmarker.c ****  * Note that we do not support suspension while writing a marker.
 100:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcmarker.c ****  * Therefore, an application using suspension must ensure that there is
 101:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcmarker.c ****  * enough buffer space for the initial markers (typ. 600-700 bytes) before
 102:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcmarker.c ****  * calling jpeg_start_compress, and enough space to write the trailing EOI
 103:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcmarker.c ****  * (a few bytes) before calling jpeg_finish_compress.  Multipass compression
 104:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcmarker.c ****  * modes are not supported at all with suspension, so those two are the only
 105:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcmarker.c ****  * points where markers will be written.
